Z||000000||86ttops||08-01-2001||05:13 PM||||I was thinking of changing my 86SE with t-tops to a fastback.  I know you can do it but I really don't know a lot about it.  Like what do I need and does it really just bolt right on.  Will the t-top interfere with anything.  It really doesn't look like it would other than I will have to drop the headliner to get the notchback panel off.  I have been looking for stuff in junk yards in the area and have come up with nothing.  Any help or links to sites would be much appreciated.||||reg||5
