Z||000002||Raydar||08-02-2001||05:04 PM||||You have to be really careful when you do the swap. The black pieces behind the T-tops are $46 each, if they are still available. Be really careful not to break them. They are held on with rivets, metal clips and butyl rubber. They have to come off in order to change the rear section. Not a lot of fun.<BR>Check out this link for T-top info... <A HREF="http://fierottop.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://fierottop.com/</A> <BR>Check the waterleak section for diagrams.<P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
